{"step_index":68,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-25T15:30:03Z","thinking":"**Testing API Behavior**\n\nI'm currently updating `tests/test_api.py`. The focus is now on comprehensively testing the API's behavior under two specific scenarios. Firstly, testing the fallback mechanism where no Blob URL is configured (expecting `/media/demo.wav`). Secondly, I'm verifying the Vercel Blob behavior when the `STREAMWAVE_BLOB_URL` environment variable is set. This covers both expected outcomes effectively.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"\"import os\\nimport pytest\\nfrom fastapi.testclient import TestClient\\nfrom app import app\\n\\nclient = TestClient(app)\\n\\n\\ndef test_health_endpoint():\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"Tests GET /api/health returns 200 OK and expected serverless metadata.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    response = client.get(\\\"/api/health\\\")\\n    assert response.status_code == 200\\n    data = response.json()\\n    assert data[\\\"status\\\"] == \\\"ok\\\"\\n    assert \\\"StreamWave\\\" in data[\\\"platform\\\"]\\n    assert \\\"environment\\\" in data\\n    assert \\\"blob_storage_configured\\\" in data\\n    assert \\\"timestamp\\\" in data\\n\\n\\ndef test_get_complete_media_catalogue():\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"Tests GET /api/media returns full catalogue array with local fallback media URLs.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    response = client.get(\\\"/api/media\\\")\\n    assert response.status_code == 200\\n    items = response.json()\\n    assert isinstance(items, list)\\n    assert len(items) == 8\\n    for item in items:\\n        assert \\\"id\\\" in item\\n        assert \\\"title\\\" in item\\n        assert \\\"type\\\" in item\\n        assert \\\"genre\\\" in item\\n        assert \\\"media_url\\\" in item\\n\\n\\ndef test_vercel_blob_url_environment_injection(monkeypatch):\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"Tests that setting STREAMWAVE_BLOB_URL injects Vercel Blob storage URL into media items.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    test_blob_url = \\\"https://public.blob.vercel-storage.com/demo-test-123.wav\\\"\\n    monkeypatch.setenv(\\\"STREAMWAVE_BLOB_URL\\\", test_blob_url)\\n\\n    response = client.get(\\\"/api/media/1\\\")\\n    assert response.status_code == 200\\n    item = response.json()\\n    assert item[\\\"media_url\\\"] == test_blob_url\\n\\n    health_res = client.get(\\\"/api/health\\\")\\n    assert health_res.json()[\\\"blob_storage_configured\\\"] is True\\n\\n\\ndef test_local_fallback_when_no_blob_env(monkeypatch):\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"Tests clean fallback to /media/demo.wav when no Blob environment variable is set.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    monkeypatch.delenv(\\\"STREAMWAVE_BLOB_URL\\\", raising=False)\\n    monkeypatch.delenv(\\\"VERCEL_BLOB_AUDIO_URL\\\", raising=False)\\n\\n    response = client.get(\\\"/api/media/1\\\")\\n    assert response.status_code == 200\\n  \n<truncated 3094 bytes>","Description":"\"Update test_api.py to verify Vercel Blob URL injection and fallback logic\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\dell\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457\\\\tests\\\\test_api.py\"","toolAction":"\"Updating test_api.py with Vercel Blob tests\"","toolSummary":"\"Updating test_api.py with Vercel Blob tests\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
{"step_index":69,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-25T15:30:09Z","content":"Created At: 2026-08-25T17:30:09+02:00\nCompleted At: 2026-08-25T17:30:09+02:00\nCreated file file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/brain/228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457/tests/test_api.py with requested content.\nIf relevant, proactively run terminal commands to execute this code for the USER. Don't ask for permission."}
{"step_index":70,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-25T15:30:09Z","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"\"# StreamWave Serverless Media Platform\\n\\nAcademic prototype of a serverless media streaming application built for **StreamWave Entertainment** (a fictional Zimbabwean entertainment company). Constructed with **Python 3.12** and **FastAPI**, engineered specifically for deployment on **Vercel Functions** with **Vercel Blob Storage** support.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 🚀 Key Features & Architectural Highlights\\n\\n- **Vercel Serverless Native**: Designed without continuous background processes, SQLite, or runtime filesystem writes to respect Vercel's read-only/ephemeral execution model.\\n- **Vercel Blob Integration**: Supports hosting demonstration audio files on Vercel Blob storage (`https://<hash>.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/demo.wav`), while preserving a local static fallback (`/media/demo.wav`).\\n- **Zero Media Proxying**: Media audio bytes are fetched directly by the browser from Vercel Blob CDN or the local static folder. Audio bytes are never proxied through FastAPI serverless endpoints.\\n- **FastAPI & Pydantic Validation**: Strict type annotations, security middleware headers, and Pydantic schema validation for all requests and responses.\\n- **Structured Logged Playback Events**: `POST /api/play-events` validates media IDs, attaches UTC server timestamps, and emits structured JSON event logs directly to stdout.\\n- **StreamWave Responsive UI**: Dark graphite styling (`#121214`), restrained red accent (`#e50914`), clean rectangular media cards, accessibility-focused HTML5 audio player, and `<dialog>` details modal.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## ☁️ Vercel Blob Integration & Setup\\n\\nReference Documentation:\\n- [Vercel Blob Overview](https://vercel.com/docs/vercel-blob)\\n- [Vercel CLI Blob Documentation](https://vercel.com/docs/cli/blob)\\n\\n### 1. Creating a Vercel Blob Store\\n1. Go to your [Vercel Dashboard](https://vercel.com/dashboard).\\n2. Select your project (or create a new Vercel project).\\n3. Navigate to **Storage** -> **Create Database** -> **Vercel Blob**.\\n4. Select **Public** store type and create the Blob store.\\n\\n###\n<truncated 3112 bytes>","Description":"\"Update README.md with Vercel Blob storage documentation and configuration guide\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\dell\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457\\\\README.md\"","toolAction":"\"Updating README.md with Vercel Blob docs\"","toolSummary":"\"Updating README.md with Vercel Blob docs\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
