{"step_index":98,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-25T15:45:51Z","thinking":"**Verifying CSS Rules**\n\nI'm now carefully verifying the CSS rules for the stylesheet. I'm focusing on the dark graphite background, white text, and restrained red accent, making sure those are present. I'm also reviewing the responsive grid columns, ensuring the correct number of columns are used for different screen sizes.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"\"/* ==========================================================================\\n   StreamWave Entertainment - Responsive Media Platform Stylesheet\\n   Dark Graphite Theme with Restrained Red Accent\\n   ========================================================================== */\\n\\n:root {\\n    --bg-base: #121214;\\n    --bg-surface: #18181c;\\n    --bg-elevated: #222228;\\n    --bg-hover: #2e2e36;\\n    \\n    --border-color: #2e2e38;\\n    --border-focus: #e50914;\\n\\n    --text-primary: #f4f4f6;\\n    --text-secondary: #a0a0ab;\\n    --text-muted: #6e6e7a;\\n\\n    --accent-red: #e50914;\\n    --accent-red-hover: #b80710;\\n    --accent-red-subtle: rgba(229, 9, 20, 0.15);\\n\\n    --font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\\n    --radius-sm: 4px;\\n    --radius-md: 6px;\\n    \\n    --shadow-card: 0 4px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);\\n    --shadow-dialog: 0 16px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);\\n}\\n\\n/* Base Resets */\\n*, *::before, *::after {\\n    box-sizing: border-box;\\n    margin: 0;\\n    padding: 0;\\n}\\n\\nhtml {\\n    overflow-x: hidden;\\n    scroll-behavior: smooth;\\n}\\n\\nbody {\\n    background-color: var(--bg-base);\\n    color: var(--text-primary);\\n    font-family: var(--font-family);\\n    line-height: 1.5;\\n    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\\n    min-height: 100vh;\\n    display: flex;\\n    flex-direction: column;\\n    padding-bottom: 110px; /* Space so fixed audio player never obscures footer */\\n    overflow-x: hidden;\\n}\\n\\na {\\n    color: inherit;\\n    text-decoration: none;\\n}\\n\\nbutton, input, select {\\n    font-family: inherit;\\n    font-size: inherit;\\n}\\n\\n/* Accessibility Focus Visible */\\n*:focus-visible {\\n    outline: 2px solid var(--accent-red);\\n    outline-offset: 2px;\\n}\\n\\n/* Reduced Motion */\\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\\n    *, *::before, *::after {\\n        animation-duration: 0.01ms !important;\\n        transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n/* Navigation Bar */\\n.navbar {\\n    background-color: var(--bg-surface);\n<truncated 16982 bytes>","Description":"\"Update public/css/styles.css with 4-3-2-1 column grid, 2-line title clamping, keyboard focus, and mobile responsiveness\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\dell\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457\\\\public\\\\css\\\\styles.css\"","toolAction":"\"Updating public/css/styles.css\"","toolSummary":"\"Updating public/css/styles.css\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
