suring the fixed audio bar never obscures content or footer text.\\n- **Mobile Collapse Toggle**: Integrated a mobile minimize/expand button (`#player-toggle-btn`).\\n- **Academic Disclaimer Footer**: Added an explicit footer explaining the non-commercial academic nature of the prototype.\\n\\n### 5. Responsive Grid Breakdown\\n- **Large Desktops (≥1200px)**: 4 columns.\\n- **Medium Desktops (900px – 1199px)**: 3 columns.\\n- **\n<truncated 1034 bytes>","Description":"\"Update walkthrough.md with interface refinements documentation\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\dell\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457\\\\walkthrough.md\"","toolAction":"\"Updating walkthrough.md\"","toolSummary":"\"Updating walkthrough.md\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
